  "title": "log3gpp: remove #if 0'ed and commented-out stub and unmaintained code.",
  "description": "wtap_register_phonelog() is unmaintained and is already out-of-date;\nfuture API changes will render it further out-of-date (and no rationale\nis given for passing TRUE as the \"add this first\" flag to\nwtap_register_open_info()).\n\nThe code to support packet writing is all stubs; if it's useful to\nsupport writing files in this format, write the code to do so and submit\nit.  The stubs in question represent a small fraction of the code\nnecessary to support this, and don't add much.",
